{"id": "1549675901761888306", "channel_id": "1549675901761888306", "author_id": "1485258210209435701", "author_name": "morimensstaff06", "content": "**V2.6.1 坏坏档案照**\n\n「来来来，都站好了！信息牌摆正，准备拍照。」\n「要像做了坏事被逮住一样，不可以嬉皮笑脸！」\n\n根据你此前的了解，负誓·奥吉尔最可能犯什么错呢？在他空白的信息牌上写下“罪名”吧！校务处会给你「银芯×200」作为拍照辛苦费📷。\n\n——✦——✦—— ✦✦✦ ——✦——✦——\n\n**V2.6.1 Naughty Mugshots**\n\n*\"Alright, everyone, line up! Hold your placards straight. Time for your mugshots!\"\n\"Show me your 'caught in the act' face—no cheeky grins!\"*\n\nSo, what do you think Ogier: Oathbound would get busted for? Fill in his blank placard with a \"charge\"! The Administrative Office has Silver ×200 for you as a little thank-you for taking his mugshot 📷.\n\n——✦——✦—— ✦✦✦ ——✦——✦——\n\n**V2.6.1 장난기 가득 머그샷!**\n\n\"자자, 모두 똑바로 서! 정보판 똑바로 들고, 사진 찍는다.\"\n\"버릇없는 짓거리 하다 붙잡힌 사람처럼 찍어야 된다고. 히죽거리지 좀 마!\"\n\n지금까지 알아본 바로, 서약·오지에가 가장 저지를 법한 잘못은 무엇일까요? 그의 빈 정보판 위에 '죄명'을 적어 주세요! 학사처에서 사진 촬영📷 수고비로 '은심×200'을 드립니다.\n\n<@&1440553558238953482>", "timestamp": "2026-09-16T06:58:46.566000+00:00", "pinned": true, "flags": 256, "thread_id": "1549675901761888306", "reactions": [{"emoji": "Ogier_cheer", "emoji_id": "1468259351889318049", "count": 18}, {"emoji": "Golih_spend", "emoji_id": "1468259820875415728", "count": 3}], "attachments": [{"id": "1549675902579900476", "filename": "CN_1.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 878879, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1549675901761888306/1549675902579900476/CN_1.jpg?ex=6aab8fa6&is=6aaa3e26&hm=9d5c15b5ba027f0467a6ca43ca19b88c044158e259720519230b0fc1f809ad0b&"}, {"id": "1549675903238279229", "filename": "EN_1.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 892534, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1549675901761888306/1549675903238279229/EN_1.jpg?ex=6aab8fa6&is=6aaa3e26&hm=f5cbd736acfd8278ec2613947a5bdcc72eba4d0bb337590dbb34c53ec5e4ea2b&"}, {"id": "1549675903838330920", "filename": "KR_1.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 902312, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1549675